<title>USA: Handy &amp; Harman names LeBlanc president, COO.</title>
<headline>Handy &amp; Harman names LeBlanc president, COO.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Handy &amp; Harman said Tuesday it named Robert LeBlanc president and chief operating officer.</p>
<p>President Frank Grzelecki will assume the title of vice chairman until his anticipated retirement in 1998. After his retirement he will continue on the Handy &amp; Harman board, the company said.</p>
<p>LeBlanc was executive vice president of the company.</p>
</text>
